SUMMARY:Music in the Mountains Day
DESCRIPTION:Music in the Mountains Day\nOctober 10\, 2026\nEnjoy live music by local musicians surrounded by the gardens and beautiful mountain vistas! *NOTE* Due to the forecast of rain on Saturday\, Oct. 10\, this event will be held inside the Baker Center Lobby. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n10:00 – 11:30 A.M.\nUNCA Bluegrass Band\nBluegrass\n\n\n11:45 A.M. – 1:15 P.M.\nSplit Rail – Blue Grass\n\n\nClassic & new bluegrass\, country & gospel. From Lester and Earl to James Taylor\n\n\n\n\n1:30 – 3:00 P.M.\nBailey Mountain Cloggers\nDance\n\n\n1:30 – 3:00 P.M.\nJake Yochem Band\nBlue Grass
